- content_for :title, "Affiliate disclosure"

%section.page-header
  .container
    %h1.page-header__title Affiliate disclosure

.container.prose
  %p
    StepsFrom is free to use. When you follow a link to a booking site (such as Booking.com, Expedia,
    Hotels.com, Vrbo, Agoda or Trip.com) and complete a stay, the booking site may pay us a commission. You pay the
    same price as you would booking directly.
  %p
    Links to booking sites are marked as sponsored. Commissions never affect which properties we list, the badges
    they get, or the order of results — see
    = succeed "." do
      = link_to "how we verify and rank", how_we_verify_path
  %p We are not owned by, and do not speak for, any booking site.
